		<P CLASS="Tablefootnote_m" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(1)<FONT STYLE="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>Based on 16,356,056<FONT CLASS="nobreak"> </FONT>shares of Common Stock issued and outstanding as of the date of this prospectus.</P>
		<P CLASS="Tablefootnote_m" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(2)<FONT STYLE="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>Based on 44,777,109<FONT CLASS="nobreak"> </FONT>shares of Common Stock issued and outstanding after the public offering.</P>
		<P CLASS="Tablefootnote_m" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(3)<FONT STYLE="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>Our board of directors determined it was in the best interest of the Company and its stockholders to grant Sean Dollinger an award of 1,000,000 RSUs, under the Company&#x2019;s 2021 Plan, to compensate him for his employment with the Company. Mr.&#x00a0;Dollinger was granted an award of 1,000,000 RSUs under the Company&#x2019;s 2021 Plan, with one (1)&#x00a0;RSU corresponding to one (1)&#x00a0;share of Common Stock. The RSUs will only start vesting once the 2021 Plan has been amended to increase the number of shares reserved under the 2021 Plan to cover the issuance of the shares of Common Stock underlying the RSUs. Accordingly, these 1,000,000 RSUs are not reflected in this table.</P>
		</DIV>

